  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5994,
      "text": "By the dawn,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5995,
      "text": "and the ten nights[1],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5996,
      "text": "and the even and the odd[2],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5997,
      "text": "and by the night when it comes,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5998,
      "text": "are these oaths not sufficient for those who have sense?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5999,
      "text": "Have you not considered how your Lord dealt with ‘Ād",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6000,
      "text": "of Iram[3], who were people of great stature,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6001,
      "text": "the like of whom had never been created in the land;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6002,
      "text": "and Thamūd, who carved out the rocks in the Valley;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6003,
      "text": "and the mighty and powerful[4] Pharaoh?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6004,
      "text": "All of them transgressed in the land,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6005,
      "text": "and spread therein much corruption,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6006,
      "text": "so your Lord poured upon them a scourge of punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6007,
      "text": "Indeed, your Lord is ever vigilant.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6008,
      "text": "As for man, when he is tested by his Lord by honoring him and bestowing blessings upon him, he says, “My Lord has [deservedly] honored me[5]!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6009,
      "text": "But when he is tested by restricting his provision, he says, “My Lord has [undeservedly] humiliated me!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6010,
      "text": "No indeed[6]! You are not kind to the orphan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6011,
      "text": "nor do you urge one another to feed the needy,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6012,
      "text": "and you greedily consume the entire inheritance[7],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6013,
      "text": "and love wealth immensely.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6014,
      "text": "No indeed! When the earth is crushed over and over,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6015,
      "text": "and your Lord comes[8] with the angels, rank after rank,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6016,
      "text": "and Hell is brought near on that Day – this is when man will understand, but what is the use of that understanding?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 89,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفَجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Fajr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dawn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 593,
      "ruku": 531,
      "hizbQuarter": 237,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
